{"id":111,"flavor":[{"games":["Legends: Arceus"],"text":"Ludicrously strong—when it butts heads with a mountain, it is the mountain that shatters. But its short legs struggle with turns, and it is incapable of stopping unless it collides with something."},{"games":["Shield","Crystal"],"text":"It can remember only one thing at a time. Once it starts rushing, it forgets why it started."},{"games":["Sword","X","FireRed"],"text":"Strong, but not too bright, this Pokémon can shatter even a skyscraper with its charging tackles."},{"games":["Let’s Go, Eevee!","Let’s Go, Pikachu!","Yellow"],"text":"A Pokémon with a one-track mind. Once it charges, it won’t stop running until it falls asleep."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Sapphire"],"text":"Rhyhorn’s brain is very small. It is so dense, while on a run it forgets why it started running in the first place. It apparently remembers sometimes if it demolishes something."},{"games":["Omega Ruby","Ruby"],"text":"Rhyhorn runs in a straight line, smashing everything in its path. It is not bothered even if it rushes headlong into a block of steel. This Pokémon may feel some pain from the collision the next day, however."},{"games":["Y","HeartGold","Gold"],"text":"It is inept at turning because of its four short legs. It can only charge and run in one direction."},{"games":["White 2","Black 2","White","Black","Platinum"],"text":"Its powerful tackles can destroy anything. However, it is too slow witted to help people work."},{"games":["SoulSilver","Silver"],"text":"It doesn’t care if there is anything in its way. It just charges and destroys all obstacles."},{"games":["Pearl","Diamond"],"text":"Its body is clad in a thick hide, and its tackles topple buildings. Unfortunately, it is not smart."},{"games":["LeafGreen"],"text":"Its massive bones are 1,000 times harder than human bones. Its TACKLE can knock a semitrailer flying."},{"games":["Emerald"],"text":"Once it starts running, it doesn’t stop. Its tiny brain makes it so stupid that it can’t remember why it started running in the first place."},{"games":["Blue","Red"],"text":"Its massive bones are 1000 times harder than human bones. It can easily knock a trailer flying."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Lightning Rod","hidden":false,"description":"The Pokémon draws in all Electric-type moves. Instead of taking damage from them, its Sp. Atk stat is boosted."},{"name":"Rock Head","hidden":false,"description":"Protects the Pokémon from recoil damage."},{"name":"Reckless","hidden":true,"description":"Powers up moves that have recoil damage."}],"eggGroups":["Monster","Field"],"genderRate":4,"hatchCounter":20,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"slow","habitat":"rough terrain","color":"Gray","shape":"Quadruped","evolution":{"id":111,"name":"Rhyhorn","condition":null,"children":[{"id":112,"name":"Rhydon","condition":"Lv. 42","children":[{"id":464,"name":"Rhyperior","condition":"Trade, holding Protector","children":[]}]}]},"moves":{"game":"Scarlet / Violet","level":[[1,33],[1,39],[5,479],[10,523],[15,30],[20,184],[25,23],[30,350],[35,529],[40,36],[45,89],[50,444],[55,224],[60,32]],"machine":[59,776,34,523,242,174,91,38,406,529,414,89,283,203,263,126,424,53,484,667,58,423,196,341,189,398,182,240,156,179,46,350,157,317,201,184,815,214,479,684,446,707,444,164,241,916,14,36,851,168,87,422,85,253],"egg":[68,174,407,470,368,397],"tutor":[]},"cards":[{"id":"sv7-74","name":"Rhyhorn","set":"Stellar Crown","date":"2024-09-13","rarity":"Common","number":"74","artist":null,"img":"sv7/74"},{"id":"sv3pt5-111","name":"Rhyhorn","set":"151","date":"2023-09-22","rarity":"Common","number":"111","artist":"GOSSAN","img":"sv3pt5/111"},{"id":"swsh11-89","name":"Rhyhorn","set":"Lost Origin","date":"2022-09-09","rarity":"Common","number":"89","artist":"Scav","img":"swsh11/89"},{"id":"swsh1-96","name":"Rhyhorn","set":"Sword & Shield","date":"2020-02-07","rarity":"Common","number":"96","artist":"Sekio","img":"swsh1/96"},{"id":"swsh1-97","name":"Rhyhorn","set":"Sword & Shield","date":"2020-02-0